#: ../../source/hardware_SKILL.md:10
msgid ""
"Use the `i2c` and `spi` tools to interact with sensors, displays, and "
"other peripherals connected to the board."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hardware_SKILL.md:12
msgid "Quick Start"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hardware_SKILL.md:29
msgid "Before You Start — Pinmux Setup"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hardware_SKILL.md:31
msgid ""
"Most I2C/SPI pins are shared with WiFi on Sipeed boards. You must "
"configure pinmux before use."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hardware_SKILL.md:33
msgid "See `references/board-pinout.md` for board-specific commands."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hardware_SKILL.md:35
msgid "**Common steps:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hardware_SKILL.md:36
msgid "Stop WiFi if using shared pins: `/etc/init.d/S30wifi stop`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hardware_SKILL.md:37
msgid "Load i2c-dev module: `modprobe i2c-dev`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hardware_SKILL.md:38
msgid "Configure pinmux with `devmem` (board-specific)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hardware_SKILL.md:39
msgid "Verify with `i2c detect` and `i2c scan`"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hardware_SKILL.md:41
msgid "Safety"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hardware_SKILL.md:43
msgid ""
"**Write operations** require `confirm: true` — always confirm with the "
"user first"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hardware_SKILL.md:44
msgid "I2C addresses are validated to 7-bit range (0x03-0x77)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hardware_SKILL.md:45
msgid "SPI modes are validated (0-3 only)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hardware_SKILL.md:46
msgid "Maximum per-transaction: 256 bytes (I2C), 4096 bytes (SPI)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hardware_SKILL.md:48
msgid "Common Devices"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/hardware_SKILL.md:50
